      "filename": "Historical trial in red fort.jpg",
      "title": "File:Historical trial in red fort.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/Historical_trial_in_red_fort.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
